  "description": "How many days would you last? 👇\n\nIn 1942 a German submarine sank the British ship SS Ben Lomond. Steward Poon Lim survived 133 days alone on a wooden raft in the Atlantic, catching rainwater, fish, seabirds and even a shark, until Brazilian fishermen found him.\nHe said: \"I hope no one will ever have to break that record.\"\n#truestory #survival #poonlim #ocean #shorts",
